Title: HAL_PCD_EP_GetRxCount returns incorrect value for multi-packet transfers

Body:
**Describe the set-up**
 I'm using a Blue Pill STM32F103C8T6
I'm running arm-none-eabi-gcc (Arch Repository) 9.2.0
I am using the code from this repository

**Describe the bug**
HAL_PCD_EP_GetRxCount returns incorrect value for multi-packet transfers. It returns the value for the last packet in the transfer.

stm32f1xx_hal_pcd.c line 2142 increases the value
ep->xfer_count += count;
however, when there is another paket to receive on line 2156 it calls
